# Evade Shaders - option names and descriptions shown on the shader options screen.

profile=Quality Profile
profile.comment=Sets every option at once. POTATO costs about the same as vanilla; LOW suits integrated graphics; MEDIUM, HIGH and ULTRA add softer shadows, god rays, reflections and volumetric clouds.
profile.POTATO=Potato
profile.POTATO.comment=Vanilla-like cost: better lighting, colours and tonemapping only.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=For integrated graphics: small hard shadows, simple sky and simple water.
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.MEDIUM.comment=Soft shadows, realistic sky, 2D clouds, water reflections, bloom and anti-aliasing.
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=Contact-hardening shadows, coloured glass shadows, god rays and glass reflections.
profile.ULTRA=Ultra
profile.ULTRA.comment=Large shadow map, volumetric clouds and the most samples everywhere.

screen.SHADOWS_SCREEN=Shadows
screen.SHADOWS_SCREEN.comment=Sun and moon shadows: on/off, softness, resolution and distance.
screen.LIGHTING_SCREEN=Lighting
screen.LIGHTING_SCREEN.comment=Sunlight, block light colour and glowing blocks.
screen.SKY_SCREEN=Sky & Atmosphere
screen.SKY_SCREEN.comment=Sky model, stars, clouds, god rays and fog.
screen.WATER_SCREEN=Water & Reflections
screen.WATER_SCREEN.comment=Waves, reflections, refraction and underwater effects.
screen.FOLIAGE_SCREEN=Foliage
screen.FOLIAGE_SCREEN.comment=Waving grass, flowers, crops and leaves.
screen.POST_SCREEN=Camera & Colour
screen.POST_SCREEN.comment=Anti-aliasing, sharpening, bloom, tonemapping and colour grading.
screen.DIMENSION_SCREEN=Nether & End
screen.DIMENSION_SCREEN.comment=Looks for the other dimensions.

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Shadows from the sun and moon. Off is the cheapest: lighting then follows the game's sky light.
option.SHADOW_FILTER=Shadow Softness Style
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=Hard is fastest. Soft blurs edges evenly. Contact-Hardening is sharp near the caster and soft far from it, like real shadows.
value.SHADOW_FILTER.0=Hard
value.SHADOW_FILTER.1=Soft
value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=Contact-Hardening
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Detail of shadows. Higher is sharper and slower.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far away shadows are drawn, in blocks. Beyond it, lighting follows the game's sky light.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Blur
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=How blurry soft shadow edges are.
option.COLORED_SHADOWS=Coloured Glass Shadows
option.COLORED_SHADOWS.comment=Sunlight through stained glass is tinted with the glass colour.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the path of the sun and moon so shadows are never perfectly straight.

option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH=Sunlight Strength
option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of direct sun and moon light.
option.WARM_BLOCKLIGHT=Warm Block Light
option.WARM_BLOCKLIGHT.comment=Torches, lanterns and fire cast warm orange light. Brightness stays exactly vanilla.
option.EMISSIVE_BLOCKS=Glowing Blocks
option.EMISSIVE_BLOCKS.comment=Glowstone, lava, torches, lanterns and other light sources glow in their own colours.
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH=Glow Strength
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH.comment=How bright glowing blocks are.
option.FOLIAGE_TRANSLUCENCY=Backlit Leaves
option.FOLIAGE_TRANSLUCENCY.comment=Leaves and grass glow softly when the sun shines through them.

option.SKY_MODEL=Sky Style
option.SKY_MODEL.comment=Realistic simulates sunlight scattering in the air for real sunrises and sunsets. Simple uses the game's sky colours and is cheaper.
value.SKY_MODEL.0=Simple
value.SKY_MODEL.1=Realistic
option.STARS=Stars
option.STARS.comment=A twinkling starfield at night.
option.CLOUD_MODE=Cloud Style
option.CLOUD_MODE.comment=Vanilla keeps the game's clouds. Soft draws a smooth noise cloud layer. Volumetric draws 3D clouds with real depth (expensive).
value.CLOUD_MODE.0=Off
value.CLOUD_MODE.1=Vanilla
value.CLOUD_MODE.2=Soft
value.CLOUD_MODE.3=Volumetric
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=How much of the sky is covered by clouds (more when it rains).
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=God Rays
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Visible beams of light through gaps in leaves and terrain. Needs Shadows.
option.VL_SAMPLES=God Ray Quality
option.VL_SAMPLES.comment=Samples per pixel for god rays. More is smoother and slower.
option.VL_STRENGTH=God Ray Strength
option.VL_STRENGTH.comment=How bright god rays are.
option.FOG_DENSITY=Haze
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Thickness of distant haze. Blindness, Darkness, lava and powder snow fog always stay at least as strong as vanilla.
option.BORDER_FOG=Render Distance Fog
option.BORDER_FOG.comment=Softly hides the edge of the loaded world.

option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Animated waves on water surfaces.
option.WAVE_HEIGHT=Wave Height
option.WAVE_HEIGHT.comment=How rough the water surface looks.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water Reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky reflects only the sky. Screen-Space also reflects terrain and mobs that are on screen.
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=Sky
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.2=Screen-Space
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Quality
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Steps used to trace screen-space reflections. More is more accurate and slower.
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Water Refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=Waves bend the view of what is under the water.
option.GLASS_REFLECTIONS=Glass Reflections
option.GLASS_REFLECTIONS.comment=Glass, stained glass and ice reflect the sky and surroundings.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Underwater Caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Rippling patterns of light on surfaces while you are underwater.
option.UNDERWATER_WOBBLE=Underwater Wobble
option.UNDERWATER_WOBBLE.comment=A gentle wobble of the view while underwater.

option.WAVING_PLANTS=Waving Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment=Grass, flowers and crops sway in the wind (more in storms).
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Waving Leaves
option.WAVING_LEAVES.comment=Leaves and vines sway gently in the wind.
option.WIND_STRENGTH=Wind Strength
option.WIND_STRENGTH.comment=How far plants and leaves sway.

option.TAA=Anti-Aliasing (TAA)
option.TAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges and shimmering by blending recent frames.
option.SHARPENING=Sharpening
option.SHARPENING.comment=Restores fine texture detail. Useful with anti-aliasing.
option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=A soft glow around bright lights, the sun and glowing blocks.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=How much bright light spreads.
option.TONEMAP=Tonemapping
option.TONEMAP.comment=How bright light is fitted onto the screen. Filmic (ACES) is punchy, Soft keeps colours gentle, Neutral is closest to vanilla contrast.
value.TONEMAP.0=Filmic (ACES)
value.TONEMAP.1=Soft
value.TONEMAP.2=Neutral
option.EXPOSURE=Exposure
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Overall image brightness after lighting. Does not change light levels.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Colour intensity.
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.CONTRAST.comment=Difference between light and dark areas.
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Slightly darker screen corners.
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette Strength
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH.comment=How dark the corners get.

option.NETHER_HAZE=Nether Haze
option.NETHER_HAZE.comment=Thick warm haze in the Nether.
option.END_NEBULA=End Nebula
option.END_NEBULA.comment=A slowly swirling nebula and stars in the End sky.
